Third-party data
----------------

Weather forecasts and geocoding are provided by Open-Meteo.

    Open-Meteo - https://open-meteo.com/
    Weather data by Open-Meteo.com, licensed under
    Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Open-Meteo requires no account and no API key. Real Weather Sync sends only the
city name entered by the player (to the geocoding endpoint) and the coordinates
returned by that lookup (to the forecast endpoint).


Third-party libraries
---------------------

Newtonsoft.Json (Json.NET) - Copyright (c) 2007 James Newton-King, MIT License.
    https://github.com/JamesNK/Newtonsoft.Json

Newtonsoft.Json is NOT redistributed with Real Weather Sync. The copy that ships
with Cities: Skylines II (Cities2_Data/Managed/Newtonsoft.Json.dll) is referenced
at build time with <Private>false</Private> and resolved from the game at runtime.

Cities: Skylines II game and Colossal Order engine assemblies are referenced at
build time only and are not redistributed.


